11
00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:14.780
Wade: He's a negative person.

12
00:04:14.780 --> 00:04:16.940
David Mendenhall: I can bring you down with Tales of woe.

13
00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:25.259
Kostadis Roussos: But, oh, yeah, but dude, when you bring me down to Tales of woe, then I have to go get alcohol, I have to, like, question the meaning of life.

14
