Wade: Are you saying I need to get better at my downtroddenness? I could take lessons.

15
00:04:32.460 --> 00:04:35.430
Kostadis Roussos: Man, can't you just let somebody have something?

16
00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:39.100
Wade: No. Everybody needs to be as miserable as me all the time.

17
00:04:41.270 --> 00:04:44.180
